                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.01/2283: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Algiers</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Wiley</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-06-17">June 17, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1147. For Murphy. Your telegram, June 16th.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d126-f1"/>
                    Approve your suggestion contained in paragraph third before end. Will telegraph
                    again.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
